  "description": "The Colonel is the longest running DEAN Titanium mountain bike. It has been one of the definitive custom hardtails for decades . While the mountain bike has seen many changes, the titanium hardtail continues to be one of the best mountain bikes around. Our new Colonel hardtail has gotten some progressive updates to be more of a trail-style mountain bike. We bumped it to 130mm travel (don’t worry XC racers we still make a titanium XC bike), given the bike 29”x2.5” tire clearance with our intelligently engineered 3D printed design, and made the it future proof with 6/4 titanium UDH dropouts allowing to match with Sram transmission as well as standards like Shimano SLX, XT and XTR. Whether you are cranking out a hot lap on your favorite local trail, taking on Downieville, or adventuring the C.T. the Colonel is perfect no BS titanium hardtail.",
